package CanvasNet {
    part def CanvasNetViewer {
        doc /* The static class that lists the built-in image sources (raster, SVG, PDF, PPTX, VSDX, OpenSCAD, Vega-Lite, and Mermaid, in a fixed order; adapters over the SourceLoader of the Imaging subsystem, so a linked file and a rendered file are drawn by the same code as the canvasnet tool) and the extensions they claim, creates a new FolderImageResolver for one render (with optional extra sources placed after the built-in ones, so the later source wins), and renders any file by path or from a stream as a ViewerImage that owns the picture and carries the format, the page drawn and the page count, the notes (with detail, location, and origin), the printed text, the anchors of a model, and the embedded images. A document link chooses its page, slide, or model view, and a diagram link its theme, with the fragment of the link (page=N, slide=N, view=name, theme=name; page 1 without one). ViewerRenderOptions carries the requested size, the page, the resolution, the background, the model options, the sandbox folder, the strictness switch, extra sources, and a cancellation token. A vector file is drawn at the requested size, a raster is fitted or scaled by the viewer. The class is static and stateless, and every call builds its own resolver. The built-in sources declare the prefixes def. (a model) and param. (a chart) and set the variables of a model and the parameters of a chart from the fragment of a link, and ViewerRenderOptions.VegaLite (ChartOptions) sets the parameters of a chart that is rendered directly, so the command line, the library and an embedded file draw a parameterized chart the same way. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer/CanvasNetViewer.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer/LoaderImageSource.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer/ViewerRenderOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer/ViewerImage.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer/NamespaceDoc.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer.Tests/CanvasNetViewerTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer.Tests/CanvasNetViewerSystemIntegrationTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer.Tests/CanvasNetViewerFragmentTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer.Tests/CanvasNetViewerParameterFragmentTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer.Tests/CanvasNetViewerRenderOptionsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Viewer.Tests/ViewerFixtures.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-viewer/canvas-net-viewer.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-viewer/canvas-net-viewer.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-viewer/canvas-net-viewer.yaml */
    }
}
